---
// Dropzone.astro
---
<div class="w-full">
  <div
    id="dropzone"
    class="relative group border-2 border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-500/70 bg-slate-900/40 hover:bg-slate-900/70 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-center transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden shadow-inner"
  >
    <!-- Input oculto con validación estricta de accept -->
    <input
      type="file"
      id="fileInput"
      multiple
      accept=".svg,image/svg+xml"
      class="hidden"
    />

    <!-- Fondo de resplandor sutil al hacer hover o dragover -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-4">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/80 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-emerald-500/50 group-hover:shadow-lg group-hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 transition-all duration-300">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 16a4 4 0 01-.88-7.903A5 5 0 1115.9 6L16 6a5 5 0 011 9.9M15 13l-3-3m0 0l-3 3m3-3v12" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-1">
        <p class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-200">
          Arrastra y suelta tus archivos <span class="text-emerald-400">SVG</span> aquí
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
          o haz clic para seleccionar de tus archivos
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700/70 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.166 4.999A11.954 11.954 0 0010 1.944 11.954 11.954 0 0017.834 5c.11.65.166 1.32.166 2.001 0 5.225-3.34 9.67-8 11.317C5.34 16.67 2 12.225 2 7c0-.682.057-1.35.166-2.001zm11.541 3.708a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <span>Filtro de seguridad estricto: Solo SVG (Validación y Sanitización Anti-XSS)</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra de progreso secuencial -->
    <div id="queueProgressContainer" class="hidden absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1.5 bg-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
      <div id="queueProgressBar" class="h-full bg-emerald-500 transition-all duration-200" style="width: 0%"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
